{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back in time on a mission from the Morse Gods, to prove that Morse is, and always will be, the ultimate method of communication. Compete against inferior forms of communication: horse, car, train, and a guy running really fast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transmit messages using authentic morse code.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against other forms of communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up the skill of morse code while playing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 hand-made levels, designed to challenge you on speed, tactics and accuracy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different maps: Ancient Arabia, Medieval England, 1850s USA, and Industrial England.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in level editor, and fan-made levels (using the Steam Workshop).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless modes, to test your skills even further.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selection of difficulties to increase your suffering.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rule Britannia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1999720/7b0bf161be68f027dbb1f27b48cbeafbdb4fc94e.jpg"},{"name":"Adept Morser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1999720/02cecd93b6f47d0c0177d60050f085dd44ac98a4.jpg"},{"name":"Big Dave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1999720/774cf350f7ac61d00ae38612baa0cd87c0ae8f0c.jpg"},{"name":"FREEDOM!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1999720/a35996853e2b380d87079bcebd5f21a4f8715f5b.jpg"},{"name":"Memory Guru","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit